@page
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About";
}

<p>
    Camlex Online service is created for Sharepoint developers to simplify refactoring of existing code which uses hardcoded literals for CAML into compilable C# code for Camlex.NET.
    If you encountered with problems or have ideas for further development, please visit our <a href="https://github.com/sadomovalex/camlex">GitHub project site</a>.
</p>
<p>
    Conversion from expression trees to C# code is done by <a href="http://code.google.com/p/expressiontocode/">ExpressionToCode</a>.
    Site theme is given from <a href="http://www.freecsstemplates.org/">freecsstemplates.org</a>.
</p>